---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: output
input_file: examples/fixedpoint.txt
---
$ rsbdd -t -f true examples/fixedpoint.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| a     | b     | c     | *     |
|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| False | False | True  | True  |
| False | True  | Any   | True  |
| True  | Any   | Any   | True  |
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -v examples/fixedpoint.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
c;
b, c*;
a, b*, c*;
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -m -t -f true examples/fixedpoint.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| a     | b     | c     | *     |
|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| True  | Any   | Any   | True  |
--- stderr
